WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.962 --> 00:00:08.300
♪ ♪

00:00:08.301 --> 00:00:09.301
&gt;&gt; Tucker: FORMER

00:00:09.302 --> 00:00:10.502
PRESS SECRETARY SEAN SPICER WAS

00:00:10.503 --> 00:00:11.703
ON "DANCING WITH THE STARS" THIS

00:00:11.704 --> 00:00:12.037
SEASON.

00:00:12.038 --> 00:00:12.804
A LOT OF PEOPLE COMPLAINED ABOUT

00:00:12.805 --> 00:00:14.906
HIM BEING THERE, BUT HE MADE IT

00:00:14.907 --> 00:00:16.074
A LONG TIME.

00:00:16.075 --> 00:00:17.709
EIGHT WEEKS, I THINK.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:18.810
HE RECEIVED SUPPORT FROM THE

00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:19.177
PRESIDENT.

00:00:19.178 --> 00:00:19.845
HERE'S A LOOK AT HIM DANCING

00:00:19.846 --> 00:00:20.879
LAST NIGHT.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:37.462
♪ ♪

00:00:37.463 --> 00:00:43.035
[APPLAUSE]

00:00:43.036 --> 00:00:43.902
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SEAN SPICER JOINS

00:00:43.903 --> 00:00:44.302
US TONIGHT.

00:00:44.303 --> 00:00:47.305
YOU DID WHAT YOU NEEDED TO DO.

00:00:47.306 --> 00:00:47.773
YOU WENT ALL IN.

00:00:47.774 --> 00:00:48.306
YOU ARE SAVAGE.

00:00:48.307 --> 00:00:51.143
I LOVE THAT.

00:00:51.144 --> 00:00:52.878
YOU LASTED ABOUT FIVE TIMES AS

00:00:52.879 --> 00:00:54.513
LONG AS ANYONE PREDICTED THAT

00:00:54.514 --> 00:00:55.947
YOU WOULD.

00:00:55.948 --> 00:00:56.581
WHAT DID YOU THINK OF THE

00:00:56.582 --> 00:00:57.883
EXPERIENCE?

00:00:57.884 --> 00:01:00.085
&gt;&gt; HONESTLY, I HAD A BLAST.

00:01:00.086 --> 00:01:01.787
I REALLY, REALLY ENJOYED THIS,

00:01:01.788 --> 00:01:03.155
IT EXCEEDED MY EXPECTATIONS.

00:01:03.156 --> 00:01:05.390
I WENT INTO THIS THINKING ONE,

00:01:05.391 --> 00:01:06.091
TWO WEEKS, MAY BECOME I'M NOT

00:01:06.092 --> 00:01:06.858
REALLY GOOD AT THIS.

00:01:06.859 --> 00:01:08.360
BUT I WILL HAVE FUN, I WILL

00:01:08.361 --> 00:01:08.860
LEARN SOMETHING.

00:01:08.861 --> 00:01:11.663
I MADE IT TO THE QUARTERFINALS

00:01:11.664 --> 00:01:12.097
OF THIS SHOW.

00:01:12.098 --> 00:01:14.299
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT'S UNBELIEVABLE.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:17.235
&gt;&gt; I HAD A TREMENDOUS AMOUNT OF

00:01:17.236 --> 00:01:17.569
SUPPORT.

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:18.870
I THINK THE PRESIDENT OF THE

00:01:18.871 --> 00:01:20.739
UNITED STATES, DON JR., SO MANY

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:21.373
FOLKS THAT CAME OUT.

00:01:21.374 --> 00:01:21.807
JESSE WATTERS.

00:01:21.808 --> 00:01:23.708
SO MANY FOLKS THAT ARE FRIENDS

00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:26.511
AND SUPPORTERS, AND MADE THIS

00:01:26.512 --> 00:01:30.315
JOURNEY SO MUCH FUN, BUT I LOVE

00:01:30.316 --> 00:01:30.916
BEING PART OF THE SHOW.

00:01:30.917 --> 00:01:32.751
IT WAS A GREAT EXPERIENCE, AND I

00:01:32.752 --> 00:01:33.852
THINK I'M BETTER FOR IT.

00:01:33.853 --> 00:01:34.553
&gt;&gt; Tucker: TOM BERGERON IS ONE

00:01:34.554 --> 00:01:37.522
OF THE HOST, GROWTH IS KIND OF,

00:01:37.523 --> 00:01:39.724
I THOUGHT, KIND OF CONTEMPTIBLE

00:01:39.725 --> 00:01:40.425
COMPLAINT, BASICALLY ABOUT YOU

00:01:40.426 --> 00:01:41.693
GOING ON THE SHOW.

00:01:41.694 --> 00:01:42.461
YOU DIDN'T TAKE OFFENSE.

00:01:42.462 --> 00:01:43.862
YOU DECIDED NOT TO HOLD A

00:01:43.863 --> 00:01:44.196
GRUDGE.

00:01:44.197 --> 00:01:46.064
YOU ACTED LIKE IT NEVER

00:01:46.065 --> 00:01:46.431
HAPPENED.

00:01:46.432 --> 00:01:47.499
YOU WERE TOTALLY NICE.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.234
YOU JUST KEPT GOING AND REMAIN

00:01:49.235 --> 00:01:49.601
POSITIVE.

00:01:49.602 --> 00:01:50.869
HAVE TO SAY, I WAS IMPRESSED BY

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:51.169
THAT.

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.238
WAS IT HARD TO REMAIN POSITIVE

00:01:53.239 --> 00:01:56.308
WHILE HE WAS SNIPING AT YOU?

00:01:56.309 --> 00:01:57.843
&gt;&gt; WELL, YOU KNOW, IF NOT THE

00:01:57.844 --> 00:02:01.646
FIRST TIME THAT SOMEBODY HAS

00:02:01.647 --> 00:02:03.081
MADE NEGATIVE COMMENTS ABOUT ME.

00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:03.748
&gt;&gt; Tucker: [LAUGHS]

00:02:03.749 --> 00:02:04.149
GOOD POINT.

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:06.918
&gt;&gt; WHAT I WOULD RATHER DO IS

00:02:06.919 --> 00:02:08.220
LEAD BY AND SHOW BY EXAMPLE.

00:02:08.221 --> 00:02:11.056
WHAT I THINK I DEMONSTRATED IS

00:02:11.057 --> 00:02:13.758
THAT WE CAN BRING A DIVERSE

00:02:13.759 --> 00:02:14.860
GROUP OF PEOPLE TOGETHER.

00:02:14.861 --> 00:02:16.962
I LOVE SUPPORTING CONSERVATIVE

00:02:16.963 --> 00:02:17.729
PRINCIPLES.

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:18.530
AND BEING A REPUBLICAN, I'M

00:02:18.531 --> 00:02:20.132
PROUD ABOUT THAT.

00:02:20.133 --> 00:02:22.300
BUT I THINK I WANT US, OUR SIDE

00:02:22.301 --> 00:02:23.768
TO BE BETTER THAN THEIR SIDE,

00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:24.936
AND COME TOGETHER AND SHOW

00:02:24.937 --> 00:02:26.771
PEOPLE THAT WE CAN FIGHT IT OUT

00:02:26.772 --> 00:02:28.740
ON PRINCIPLES AND POLICIES, BUT

00:02:28.741 --> 00:02:29.674
THE GOOD PEOPLE, COME TOGETHER,

00:02:29.675 --> 00:02:32.677
AND I THOUGHT WHAT THIS SHOW

00:02:32.678 --> 00:02:34.546
DOES SO WELL IS BRING PEOPLE

00:02:34.547 --> 00:02:36.848
TOGETHER, SUPPORT EACH OTHER,

00:02:36.849 --> 00:02:38.216
ROUTE FOR EACH OTHER, LEAVE ALL

00:02:38.217 --> 00:02:40.118
OF THE REST OF THAT STUFF ASIDE,

00:02:40.119 --> 00:02:41.953
AND FOR TWO HOURS ONCE A WEEK,

00:02:41.954 --> 00:02:43.288
EVERYONE GETS TO BE ON

00:02:43.289 --> 00:02:43.989
EVERYBODY'S TEAM AND CHEER FOR

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:45.223
EACH OTHER.

00:02:45.224 --> 00:02:47.092
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AND YOU DID THAT.

00:02:47.093 --> 00:02:48.927
I MEAN, YOU REFUSED TO LIVE DOWN

00:02:48.928 --> 00:02:50.095
TO THEIR EXPECTATIONS OF YOU.

00:02:50.096 --> 00:02:52.330
YOU REFUSED TO EMBODY THEIR

00:02:52.331 --> 00:02:52.797
ATTACKS ON YOU.

00:02:52.798 --> 00:02:55.000
YOU WERE RELENTLESSLY CHEERFUL

00:02:55.001 --> 00:02:56.001
TO THE LAST MINUTE, NO MATTER

00:02:56.002 --> 00:02:58.537
WHAT THEY SAID OR DID.

00:02:58.538 --> 00:03:00.071
AND I JUST THOUGHT, THAT'S AN

00:03:00.072 --> 00:03:00.872
INSPIRATION TO PEOPLE.

00:03:00.873 --> 00:03:02.174
WHAT DID TRUMP SAY WHEN YOU

00:03:02.175 --> 00:03:04.142
TALKED TO HIM LAST NIGHT?

00:03:04.143 --> 00:03:06.344
&gt;&gt; WELL, I CALLED HIM.

00:03:06.345 --> 00:03:07.646
HE HAS BEEN SUPER SUPPORTIVE OF

00:03:07.647 --> 00:03:09.814
ME SINCE I LEFT THE WHITE HOUSE,

00:03:09.815 --> 00:03:10.549
AND PARTICULARLY THE LAST NINE

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:10.849
WEEKS.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:12.884
I CALLED HIM TO JUST EXPRESSED

00:03:12.885 --> 00:03:14.853
TO HIM MY APPRECIATION FOR HIS

00:03:14.854 --> 00:03:15.520
CONTINUED SUPPORT.

00:03:15.521 --> 00:03:16.755
THE VOTES ARE WHAT KEPT ME IN

00:03:16.756 --> 00:03:17.055
THIS.

00:03:17.056 --> 00:03:19.724
MY JUDGES SCORES IN MY DANCE

00:03:19.725 --> 00:03:20.392
MOVES WERE NOT EXACTLY THE

00:03:20.393 --> 00:03:27.098
HIGHEST AND MACCABEE SCORE, SO I

00:03:27.099 --> 00:03:28.066
WANTED TO SHOW HOW MUCH I

00:03:28.067 --> 00:03:29.000
APPRECIATED WHAT HE AND HIS

00:03:29.001 --> 00:03:31.203
FAMILY DID COME ALL OF HIS

00:03:31.204 --> 00:03:36.074
SUPPORTERS, FOR KEEPING ME IN TE

00:03:36.075 --> 00:03:36.908
CITY FOR NINE WEEKS.

00:03:36.909 --> 00:03:37.509
&gt;&gt; Tucker: UNBELIEVABLE.

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:38.743
I DON'T KNOW IF ANYONE HAS EVER

00:03:38.744 --> 00:03:39.411
MARSHALED THE SUPPORT OF THE

00:03:39.412 --> 00:03:41.246
PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES.

00:03:41.247 --> 00:03:43.215
ARE YOU FINALLY COMING BACK TO

00:03:43.216 --> 00:03:43.615
WASHINGTON?

00:03:43.616 --> 00:03:44.316
EVEN LIVING IN A HOTEL IN L.A.

00:03:44.317 --> 00:03:45.850
FOR NINE MONTHS.

00:03:45.851 --> 00:03:47.352
SPEAK I THINK GOD ALWAYS HAS A

00:03:47.353 --> 00:03:48.253
PLAN.

00:03:48.254 --> 00:03:49.888
TOMORROW IS MY 15TH ANNIVERSARY

00:03:49.889 --> 00:03:51.856
TO MY BEAUTIFUL WIFE, REBECCA,

00:03:51.857 --> 00:03:52.891
WHO WAS MY NUMBER ONE CHAMPION.

00:03:52.892 --> 00:03:55.660
SO I GET TO BE HOME FOR MY

00:03:55.661 --> 00:03:57.896
ANNIVERSARY, IT MEANS NOT GOT TO

00:03:57.897 --> 00:03:59.832
FIND A GIFT REAL QUICK.

